      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Belmont_Cragin%2C_Chicago",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Hall Printing Company built a 17‑acre plant beside the Northwestern railroad, further boosting manufacturing in the area.",
